sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Sender as 📧 Email Sender
    participant NGINX as 🌐 NGINX
    participant InboundW as 📥 Inbound Worker
    participant Parser as 📝 Mailparser
    participant ThreadDet as 🧵 Thread Detection
    participant ContactMatch as 🔍 Contact Match
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL
    participant Thread as 🧵 Thread
    participant Message as 📧 Message
    participant Activity as 📋 Activity
    participant Push as 🔔 Push Notification
    participant FE as 🎨 Frontend

    Sender->>NGINX: SMTP/Graph/IMAP
    NGINX->>InboundW: Raw MIME
    InboundW->>Parser: Parse MIME
    Parser->>ThreadDet: Parsed email + headers
    ThreadDet->>DB: SELECT thread_id WHERE message_id IN (References, In-Reply-To)
    alt Thread exists
        DB-->>ThreadDet: thread_id
    else New thread
        ThreadDet->>DB: INSERT thread
        DB-->>ThreadDet: new thread_id
    end
    ThreadDet->>ContactMatch: from_email
    ContactMatch->>DB: SELECT id FROM contactos WHERE email = from_email
    alt Contact exists
        DB-->>ContactMatch: contact_id
    else New lead
        ContactMatch->>DB: INSERT contact (lead)
        DB-->>ContactMatch: new contact_id
    end
    ContactMatch->>DB: INSERT message (thread_id, contact_id, direction='inbound')
    DB-->>Message: message_id
    Message->>Thread: UPDATE last_message_at, message_count++
    Message->>Activity: INSERT activity (email_received)
    Message->>Push: Real-time notification
    Push->>FE: WebSocket → UI update
    FE->>User: 🔔 New email in thread